  description: '"Thunder Dragon" + 1 Thunder monster

    Must be either Fusion
    Summoned, or Special Summoned during the turn a Thunder monster''s effect was
    activated in the hand, by Tributing 1 Thunder Effect non-Fusion Monster (in which
    case you do not use "Polymerization"). Cards cannot be added from the Main Deck
    to your opponent''s hand except by drawing them. If this card would be destroyed
    by battle or card effect, you can banish 1 Thunder monster from your GY instead.'
